sequenceDiagram
  participant Client
  participant Gateway
  participant Service
  participant Mongo as MongoDB
  Client->>Gateway: GET /api/v1/urls/code + X-API-Key
  Gateway->>Service: forward
  Service->>Service: validate API key
  Service->>Mongo: findByShortCode
  alt missing
    Service-->>Client: 404 URL_NOT_FOUND
  else found
    Service-->>Client: 200 metadata JSON
  end
